{"id":"ryadom","lemma":"рядом","pos":"adv","rank":241,"glosses":["alongside, beside, side by side, nearby","alongside, side by side","near, beside, next to"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/58/Ru-%D1%80%D1%8F%D0%B4%D0%BE%D0%BC.ogg/Ru-%D1%80%D1%8F%D0%B4%D0%BE%D0%BC.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Я хочу быть рядом с тобой.","en":"I want to be near you.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1283299","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"to be"},null,{"g":"with / from"},{"g":"you","l":"ты"}]},{"text":"Твой дом тут рядом?","en":"Is your house near here?","words":[{"g":"your"},{"g":"house, building"},{"g":"here"},null]},{"text":"Ты работаешь тут рядом?","en":"Do you work near here?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to work","l":"работать"},{"g":"here"},null]},{"text":"Тебя никогда не было рядом.","en":"You were never around.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/655997","words":[{"g":"you","l":"ты"},{"g":"never, nevermore"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null]},{"text":"Могу я сесть рядом с вами?","en":"Can I sit beside you?","words":[{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to sit down"},null,{"g":"with / from"},{"g":"you","l":"вы"}]}]}